{"id":"datura","name":"Datura","form":"tablet","status":"Documented","aliases":"","category":"Depressant","psychoactiveClass":"Deliriant","addictionPotential":"mildly addictive with a high potential for adverse side effects such as psychosis","toxicity":["toxic dosage is unknown"],"summarySources":"PsychonautWiki, TripSit","summary":"A family of plants containing various Tropane alkaloids. Produces long-lasting deliriant effects including very realistic and often unpleasant hallucinations along with short-term amnesia. Datura plants are toxic to humans, and potency varies greatly from plant-to-plant, making the drug extremely difficult to dose safely. The drug typically in reports is not regarded as recreational.","advisory":"Avoid: Yes. Just avoid it.","doseMaxTick":100,"doseUnit":"mg","doseRows":[],"durationSources":"PsychonautWiki, TripSit","durationRows":[{"roa":"Oral","onset":"20–120 min","comeup":"60–120 min","peak":"—","offset":"—","afterEffects":"—","total":"—"}],"tolerance":{"buildUp":"with repeated use","reset":"1 - 2 weeks","milestones":[{"label":"Full tolerance","value":"with repeated use","tone":"danger"},{"label":"Half tolerance","value":"3 - 7 days","tone":"warning"},{"label":"Baseline","value":"1 - 2 weeks","tone":"positive"}],"crossTolerances":[]},"subjectiveEffects":[{"name":"Abnormal heartbeat","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Abnormal_heartbeat"},{"name":"Acuity suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Acuity_suppression"},{"name":"After images","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/After_images"},{"name":"Amnesia","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Amnesia"},{"name":"Anxiety","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Anxiety"},{"name":"Auditory enhancement","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Auditory_enhancement"},{"name":"Auditory hallucinations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Auditory_hallucinations"},{"name":"Autonomous entities","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Autonomous_entities"},{"name":"Cognitive dysphoria","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Cognitive_dysphoria"},{"name":"Depression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Depression"},{"name":"Difficulty urinating","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Difficulty_urinating"},{"name":"Dizziness","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Dizziness"},{"name":"Dream potentiation","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Dream_potentiation"},{"name":"Drifting","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Drifting"},{"name":"Emotion suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Emotion_suppression"},{"name":"External hallucinations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/External_hallucinations"},{"name":"Frequent urination","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Frequent_urination"},{"name":"Increased heart rate","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Increased_heart_rate"},{"name":"Information processing suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Information_processing_suppression"},{"name":"Internal hallucinations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Internal_hallucinations"},{"name":"Language suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Language_suppression"},{"name":"Muscle cramps","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Muscle_cramps"},{"name":"Muscle spasms","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Muscle_spasms"},{"name":"Nausea","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Nausea"},{"name":"Paranoia","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Paranoia"},{"name":"Pattern recognition suppression","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Pattern_recognition_suppression"},{"name":"Perception of increased weight","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Perception_of_increased_weight"},{"name":"Peripheral information misinterpretation","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Peripheral_information_misinterpretation"},{"name":"Perspective alterations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Perspective_alterations"},{"name":"Photophobia","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Photophobia"},{"name":"Psychosis","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Psychosis"},{"name":"Pupil dilation","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Pupil_dilation"},{"name":"Restless leg syndrome","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Restless_leg_syndrome"},{"name":"Scenarios and plots","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Scenarios_and_plots"},{"name":"Settings, sceneries, and landscapes","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Settings,_sceneries,_and_landscapes"},{"name":"Shadow people","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Shadow_people"},{"name":"Spontaneous tactile sensations","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Spontaneous_tactile_sensations"},{"name":"Thought deceleration","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Thought_deceleration"},{"name":"Thought disorganization","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Thought_disorganization"},{"name":"Time distortion","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Time_distortion"},{"name":"Unspeakable horrors","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Unspeakable_horrors"},{"name":"Vibrating vision","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Vibrating_vision"},{"name":"Visual haze","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Visual_haze"},{"name":"Surreal interactions with world"},{"name":"Hallucinations"},{"name":"Dry mouth"},{"name":"Fear"},{"name":"Difficulty breathing"},{"name":"Confusion"},{"name":"Delirium"}],"combinations":[],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"PsychonautWiki","description":"Pharmacology, subjective effects, and dosage reference","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Datura"},{"title":"TripSit Factsheet","description":"Rapid harm-reduction summary and combination data","url":"https://drugs.tripsit.me/datura"},{"title":"Erowid Experience Vaults","description":"First-person experience reports and archives","url":"https://www.erowid.org/experiences/subs/exp_Datura.shtml"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/%E6%9B%BC%E9%99%80%E7%BD%97%E5%B1%9E"},{"title":"维基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-cn/%E6%9B%BC%E9%99%80%E7%BD%97%E5%B1%9E"}],"pharmacology":{"text":"The alkaloids within datura exert their effects by acting as competitive antagonists at muscarinic acetylcholine receptors, primarily muscarinic acetylcholine receptors M1 and M2. Although the precise mechanism is not understood. This inhibition of acetylcholine leads to delirium, sedation and intensely realistic hallucinations, alongside extremely uncomfortable, dysphoric and even dangerous physical side effects.","source":"PsychonautWiki","page":"Datura","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Datura#Pharmacology"},"uses":{"text":"Datura is known as a powerful and dangerous deliriant, used for shamanic and medical purposes, as well as poisons.","source":"PsychonautWiki","page":"Datura","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/Datura"},"zh":"曼陀羅屬","zhHans":"曼陀罗属","summaryZh":"曼陀羅屬（學名：Datura），梵文原稱達都羅（藏字梵文：དཱདྷུར dādhura，梵文：धत्तूर dhattūra），藏文中認作「唐超巴」的子類，是茄科下原產美洲的一個屬，但至遲在公元四世紀之前即已在亞洲生根，故作為最早移殖亞歐大陸的美洲植物被廣泛理解作亞洲原生植物。","summaryZhHans":"曼陀罗属（学名：Datura），梵文原称达都罗（藏字梵文：དཱདྷུར dādhura，梵文：धत्तूर dhattūra），藏文中认作“唐超巴”的子类，是茄科下原产美洲的一个属，但至迟在公元四世纪之前即已在亚洲生根，故作为最早移殖亚欧大陆的美洲植物被广泛理解作亚洲原生植物。"}